  "description": {
   "en": "A high school guy who doesn't trust girls anymore has been tricked too many times by girls who just wanted to get close to his good-looking older brother. After all that, he decides he’ll never trust a girl again.\n\nBut then, a pretty girl in his class suddenly starts talking to him a lot. Is she just trying to get to his brother too…? Or does she actually mean something else?",
   "ja": "女性不信の男子高校生・遠野陽太。イケメンの兄貴と近づきたい女子たちに幾度となく利用され騙されてきた彼はもう二度と女性を信じないと決めていた。そんな中、やたらと陽太に話しかけてくるクラスの美少女・北条泉が現れて！？兄貴狙い…？気になる泉の心中とはーー。疑心暗鬼ラブコメディここに開幕☆"
  },
